 r←GetPathFromProject space;row;list;acreFlag
⍝ Takes the name (top container) of an opened Cider/acre project and returns its path name.
⍝ Throws an error in case that path does not contain a folder .git/
 list←⎕SE.Cider.ListOpenProjects 0
 row←(list[;1])⍳⊂⍕space
 :If row≤≢list
     r←2⊃list[row;]
 :Else
     acreFlag←U.AcreIsAvailable
     :If acreFlag
         list⍪←⎕SE.acre.Projects 0
     :EndIf
     row←(list[;1])⍳⊂⍕space
     :If row≤≢list
         r←2⊃list[row;]
     :Else
         r←''
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
 r←U.NormalizeFolder r
 ('Not a Git-managed folder: ',r)Assert F.IsDir r,'/.git'
⍝Done
